1521	 * - `filename` must match CHUNK_FILENAME_RE (alphanumeric + hyphens/underscores + .jsonl).
1522	 * - Resolved path must be inside the project's orchestrator/chunks/ directory (defence-in-depth).
1523	 *
1524	 * @param ledgerRoot  Root directory containing all project ledger folders.
1525	 * @param slug        Project slug.
1526	 * @param filename    Chunk file name (e.g. 'WP-001-developer-r0.jsonl').
1527	 * @param repoName    Repository namespace. Used to namespace the storage path.
1528	 * @returns           File content as a UTF-8 string.
